      "src": "/audio/sentences/family-photo/1.mp3",
      "text": "Bo wants a photo with Grandpa.",
      "textSha256": "76a19ca1f7c88b8d9ae118ae7132c590bbd36349ea20f586bb653cc8dd3093ae"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/family-photo/2.mp3",
      "text": "Mom holds the camera near the door.",
