      "text": "“Stand beside me,” Grandpa tells Bo.",
      "textSha256": "36867b796a0541abaca64b092b767cdc3ea715cec906736bdba355dfc90cec65"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/family-photo/4.mp3",
